{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222030","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1522203001:1":{"text":"頼む……あんたたちの方が恵まれてるのに、なんで餓死寸前の僕たちから奪うんだよ……","source_cn":"你们不能这样……你们的生活已经比很多人都好了，为什么还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC81E3EA12DDA984","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522203002:0":{"text":"こんなの……ゲホッ！不公平じゃないか……","source_cn":"这根本……咳咳！不公平……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA04A130D9F7E0EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1522203003:0":{"text":"不公平だって？金がないのはお前の問題だろうが！","source_cn":"有什么公不公平的？你们没钱又不是我的错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4535D3BAAB479176","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522203004:1":{"text":"飢饉が続いて、俺たちだって食う物なんかない。誰もが被災者なんだよ。","source_cn":"饥荒这么久，你们没东西，难道我们就有吗？整个呼临城谁没受灾？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEE2DE0500CB9EB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522203005:0":{"text":"でも、あんたたちは……ゲホッ……金で買えるのに……","source_cn":"但是你们……咳……你们不缺粮食！你们有钱买啊……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86EC32567D46E6ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522203006:0":{"text":"畑は干ばつで全滅だし、作物も育たなくて借金まみれだよ！どこに金があるってんだ！","source_cn":"谁说我有钱了？呼临城和整片高原都干旱，我家的农田一点收...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x182EADFA89F3AC76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522203007:0":{"text":"じゃあその服は何だ？俺らの格好を見てみろ！","source_cn":"你看看你穿的是什么，我们穿的是什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85CB9E5EE0C76418","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522203008:0":{"text":"それで金がねぇって言うなら、こっちは……","source_cn":"要是你还没钱，我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5D235F1A245893B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522203009:0":{"text":"――うるさい！いいから黙れ！","source_cn":"——吵什么吵！都给我闭嘴！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x417A5D78313DC653","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522203010:0":{"text":"カリアン、これはどういうことだ。","source_cn":"卡利安，怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EE7E5554E66344E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522203011:0":{"text":"報告します。そ……その、割り込みした者がいて、周りの者が怒って……","source_cn":"报告副将，是……是有人插队，其他人有所不满……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B86F4F6EA3518E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1522203012:0":{"text":"情けないやつだ。食料の配給すらまともにできんのか！いいか、反省文十枚だ！明日までに提出しろ！","source_cn":"丢人现眼的蠢货，发放赈灾粮这点差事你都干不好，回去写十...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA2A1E6698136023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1522203013:0":{"text":"貴様らも全員、整列しろ。騒げば配給は中止だ。分かったな！","source_cn":"至于你们，全都给我站成一列，不许争抢，不然粮食不予发放！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADB907A02F563F3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1522203014:1":{"text":"順番のことは、どうだっていい！なんで、あんな金持ちまで支援を受けられるんだよ！？","source_cn":"现在已经不是插队的问题了！是他这种有钱人凭什么来领赈灾粮！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92EF874F488978D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1522203015:0":{"text":"あんた、副官なんだろ？<style=\"highlight\">ペルセウス司令官の部下</style>なら、俺らの言い分を聞いてくれよ！","source_cn":"你是副将？<style=highlight>珀尔修斯统...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D874ABAD0A8900A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1522203016:0":{"text":"言い分とはなんだ？全ての食料がお前の家に届けば、満足なのか？","source_cn":"还要怎么给你们做主？难不成要把所有赈灾粮都运到你家里去？","sta